## Proposed Changes

### Core Orchestration Async Refactoring

#### [MODIFY] [master_graph.py](file:///d:/Temp/langchain-academy/prototype/sub_agents/master_graph.py)
- Convert `execute_node` to an `async def` function and call `await execute_plan_parallel(...)` instead of the synchronous wrapper.
- Convert `run_pentest` to `async def run_pentest_async` and call `await graph.ainvoke(...)`.
- Keep the `if __name__ == "__main__":` CLI block backwards-compatible by wrapping `run_pentest_async` inside `asyncio.run()`.

#### [MODIFY] [tactical_planner_module.py](file:///d:/Temp/langchain-academy/prototype/sub_agents/tactical_planner_module.py)
- Convert `tactical_planner` node to `async def`.
- Convert `get_tactical_user_prompt` to `async def` and replace `asyncio.run(run_mcp_tool(...))` with `await run_mcp_tool(...)` directly to prevent event loop collision issues.

